<title>USA: Shikellamy School District, Pa., adjusted TIC.</title>
<headline>Shikellamy School District, Pa., adjusted TIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Public Financial Management, Inc, financial advisor to Shikellamy School District, Pa., said it recalculated First Union Capital Markets Corp's winning true interest cost for the District's $4.995 million bond issue.  First Union's adjusted TIC is 5.1302 percent, reflecting the cost of bond insurance, not the 5.111 percent originally calculated.</p>
